[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4561.91, "timestamp": "01:16:01", "text": "组件，我可以右键单击并说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4563.51, "timestamp": "01:16:03", "text": "重置所有更改，这样就可以了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4565.75, "timestamp": "01:16:05", "text": "自动恢复某种程度上是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4567.669, "timestamp": "01:16:07", "text": "以前发生过。这样我就可以改变事情了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4569.51, "timestamp": "01:16:09", "text": "实例内部。嗯，真的一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4570.87, "timestamp": "01:16:10", "text": "需要记住的重要一点是，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4573.11, "timestamp": "01:16:13", "text": "无法删除其中的任何内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4575.03, "timestamp": "01:16:15", "text": "实例。我们来看一个例子。如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4577.11, "timestamp": "01:16:17", "text": "选择这张图片，我可以点击点赞。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4579.03, "timestamp": "01:16:19", "text": "我的键盘上有退格键或删除键。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4580.87, "timestamp": "01:16:20", "text": "它会消失的。看来我已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4582.47, "timestamp": "01:16:22", "text": "把它移除了，但是当我查看时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4584.39, "timestamp": "01:16:24", "text": "图层面板，实际上它会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4586.149, "timestamp": "01:16:26", "text": "那里。所以你看，图层被隐藏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4587.99, "timestamp": "01:16:27", "text": "但它仍然存在，那是因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4589.75, "timestamp": "01:16:29", "text": "它存在于主组件中。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4591.669, "timestamp": "01:16:31", "text": "无法移除。我也动不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4593.75, "timestamp": "01:16:33", "text": "周围的事物。例如，假设"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4595.75, "timestamp": "01:16:35", "text": "我想按下这个点赞按钮，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4597.35, "timestamp": "01:16:37", "text": "我打算用尽全力把它搬走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4598.95, "timestamp": "01:16:38", "text": "可能。我做不到。主要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4600.95, "timestamp": "01:16:40", "text": "组件设置了位置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4603.59, "timestamp": "01:16:43", "text": "实例内部的事物。如果我这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4605.75, "timestamp": "01:16:45", "text": "想对一个方面进行任何关键性改变"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4608.149, "timestamp": "01:16:48", "text": "实例并将其从其主实例中分离出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4610.07, "timestamp": "01:16:50", "text": "组件，我可以将其拆卸。所以，为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4612.39, "timestamp": "01:16:52", "text": "要分离，我可以右键单击并选择分离。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4613.99, "timestamp": "01:16:53", "text": "或者我也可以在顶部这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4615.99, "timestamp": "01:16:55", "text": "设计面板。有个拆卸按钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4617.43, "timestamp": "01:16:57", "text": "这和我们分离一个物体的方式类似。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4619.27, "timestamp": "01:16:59", "text": "风格。所以，一旦它分离下来，你就能看到"}]